    The gigantic sea takes you up - up - up - as if into the sky.
Then, with a sweep, a slide, and a plunge that makes you feel dizzy, you go
plummeting down the wave.  The Maelstrom is only a mile dead ahead.  
    A huge blue whale, caught within the rushing current, thrashes and bellows
as it enters the frothy rim of the Maelstrom.  Involuntarily, you close your
eyes with horror.  The lids clench themselves together as if in a spasm.
~
110 4|16384 7
D0
Into the froth.
~
~
0 -1 11023
E
whale~
The whale looks pitifully fragile as it tossed about by the current.
~
E
hole~
The hole cascades like a waterfall into the black unknown.
~
E
froth~
The froth spits around a gaping hole in the ocean, tossing splinters into the
air.
~
S
#11023
Above the gaping maelstrom~
     Suddenly, you feel the waves subside as you are envoloped in foam.  The
boat makes a sharp half turn starboard, then shoots off in a new direction like
a thunderbolt.  At the same moment, the roaring noise of the water is drowned
by a shrill shriek.  You are now in the belt of surf that always surrounds the
whorl.  Another moment and you will go plunging into the abyss, down which you
cannot see on account of the amazing velocity with which you are born along.
~
110 16384 7
D5    
The abyss.
~
~
0 -1 11024
S
#11024
The maelstrom~
    You gaze about you with a sensation of awe, horror, and admiration.  The
boat appears to be hanging, as if by magic, midway down, upon the interior
surface of a funnel vast in circumference, prodigious in legnth, and whose
perfectly smooth sides might have been mistaken for ebony, but for the 
bewildering rapidity with which it spins around.  You watch with sickened
horror as a fishing boat makes three or four wild gyrations then plunges
headlong, once and forever, into the chaos of the foam below.
~
110 16384 7
D5
Into the foam.
~
~
0 -1 11025
E
spray chaos foam~
The spray, is no doubt, occasioned by the clashing of the great walls of the 
funnel, as they meet at the bottom.  The yell that goes up to the Heavens
out of the mist I dare not describe.     
~
S
#11025
The bottom of the maelstrom~
The spray roars around you.  You try to breath but your lungs fill with water.
You clutch at the boat...no help....

		* CRRUUUNNNNCCCCCHHHH *                  


THAT REALLY DID HURT!



Neptune sworls in from the black depths, cackling insanely, as he claims his
prize.
~
