#11029
The crags~
    As you approach the rocky crags, the ocean seems to drop out from under 
you, sending your palpitating heart into your mouth.  Then, suddlenly a huge
wave brings you up upon its drooling crest.  You hang suspended, for a moment,
before the crags, then with a wicked hurl the wave dashes you against the
rocks with a sickening crunch.

THAT REALLY DID HURT!

Neptune is before you laughing insanely!

You wake up smashed agains rocks, and realize you can only be lost...
~
