on the other side though, the relentless beatings have hollowed out a small
cave, just large enough for a ship to dock.  There are a number of footsteps
in the sand.  A large stone covers the back wall of the cave, and scraps of 
wood lie in the corner.  It seems as if this place is someone's hideaway.
~
